Package: argon-oneup-suite
Version: 1.2.4
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Depends: argon-oneup-backlight (>= 1.1.0), argon-oneup-battery (>= 1.2.4), argon-oneup-lid (>= 1.1.0), argon-oneup-sensors (>= 1.1.8), argon-power-profiles (>= 1.2.4), cm5-mmc-fix (>= 1.2.4), rpi-fake-sleep (>= 1.2.4)
Recommends: argon-oneup-plasma-widget (>= 1.1.9)
Description: Complete hardware support suite for Argon ONE UP laptop
 Metapackage that installs all drivers, services, and utilities for the
 Argon ONE UP laptop (based on Raspberry Pi 5 / Compute Module 5).
 Includes battery telemetry (CW2217), DDC/CI display backlight, magnetic lid switch,
 power profiles daemon, hardware sensors, userspace sleep/standby, and CM5 fixes.
